        "r": 308.54520000000014,
        "b": 424.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "The detergent/rinse module automatically dispenses both the detergent and the rinse agent at the appropriate times. The module is activated five times during a wash cycle. Detergent is dispensed at the beginning of the main wash cycle for one time and rinse agent at the beginning of the final rinse for four times.",
